{"title":"Quartz","sourceTitle":"Quartz/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Quartz\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Quartz (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Quartz/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Quartz/es (0% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Quartz/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Quartz (81% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Quartz/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Quartz/ru (0% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Quartz/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"石英 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div><p><br />\n</p><div style=\"float:right;\">\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Quartzo Transparente</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Clear_quartz.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/5b/Clear_quartz.png/100px-Clear_quartz.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/5b/Clear_quartz.png/150px-Clear_quartz.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/5b/Clear_quartz.png/200px-Clear_quartz.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"TC\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Fundível</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ponto de cheiro</b>\n</td>\n<td>1420°C\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Requer contêiner</b>\n</td>\n<td>Não\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"float:right;\">\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Quartzo</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Quartz.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/c/cf/Quartz.png/100px-Quartz.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/cf/Quartz.png/150px-Quartz.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/cf/Quartz.png/200px-Quartz.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"TC\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Fundível</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ponto de cheiro</b>\n</td>\n<td>1350°C\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Requer contêiner</b>\n</td>\n<td>Não\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p>Quartzo é um mineral bem comum e pode ser encontrado em larga escala em depósitos minerais em quase qualquer profundidade.\n</p><p><span id=\"Obtaining\"></span>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtenção\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtenção</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Uso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uso</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Histórico\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Histórico</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Notas\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notas</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Galeria\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Galeria</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Ver_também\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ver também</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Referências\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Referências</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\"Obten.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtenção\">Obtenção</span></h2>\n<p>O quartzo é encontrado em quase todos os tipos de rocha; As exceções são <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/bauxite\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/bauxite\">bauxita</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bauxite\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bauxite\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/kimberlite\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/kimberlite\">kimberlito</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Kimberlite\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Kimberlite\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/suevite\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/suevite\">suevita</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Suevite\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Suevite\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/marble\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/marble\">mármore</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Marble\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Marble\"> </a></span>. Pedaços da pedra também podem ser encontradas e coletados na superfície.\n</p><p>Quartzo transparente tem 20% de chance de ser encontrado ao minerar veios de quartzo.\n</p>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:Raw_quartz.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/0/08/Raw_quartz.png/300px-Raw_quartz.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"172\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/08/Raw_quartz.png/450px-Raw_quartz.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/08/Raw_quartz.png/600px-Raw_quartz.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"860\" data-file-height=\"492\" /></a><figcaption>Quartzo em diferentes tipos de pedras.</figcaption></figure>\n<p><span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<p>Quartzo, quartzo transparente e quartzo moído podem ser fundidos em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bloomery\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bloomery\">forno de lupa</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bloomery\" title=\"Bloomery\"> </a></span> para produzir <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Glass\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Glass\">vidro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Glass\" title=\"Glass\"> </a></span>. O quartzo é um ingrediente necessário no processo de fabricação de aço, no qual o quartzo moído é misturado com bauxita moída e argila refratária para produzir <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Steel_making#Creating_refractory_bricks\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Steel making\">tijolos refratários</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Steel_making#Creating_refractory_bricks\" title=\"Steel making\"> </a></span>, usados na construção da fornalha de cementação.\nO quartzo transparente pode ser usado no lugar das lajes de vidro para <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Lantern\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Lantern\">lampiões</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Lantern\" title=\"Lantern\"> </a></span> ou para produzir vidro de quartzo. Ele também é necessário para fabricar o <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rift_ward\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rift ward\">para-fendas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Rift_ward\" title=\"Rift ward\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><span id=\"History\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Hist.C3.B3rico\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Histórico\">Histórico</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"Notes\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notas\">Notas</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"Gallery\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Galeria\">Galeria</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n</ul>\n<p><span id=\"See&#95;also\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Ver_tamb.C3.A9m\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ver_também\">Ver também</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Glass\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Glass\">Vidro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Glass\" title=\"Glass\"> </a></span></li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"References\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Refer.C3.AAncias\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Referências\">Referências</span></h2>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111120439\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 396/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4150/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 698/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1098/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    4.553      1 -total\n 64.66%    2.944      2 Template:Item\n 32.04%    1.459      2 Template:Item/Smeltable\n 28.77%    1.310     10 Template:Ll\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikinew-vs_:pcache:idhash:81756-0!canonical and timestamp 20261111120439 and revision id 336794. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Obtenção","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"Quartz/pt-br","byteoffset":492,"anchor":"Obtenção","linkAnchor":"Obtenção"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Uso","number":"2","index":"2","fromtitle":"Quartz/pt-br","byteoffset":949,"anchor":"Uso","linkAnchor":"Uso"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Histórico","number":"3","index":"3","fromtitle":"Quartz/pt-br","byteoffset":1599,"anchor":"Histórico","linkAnchor":"Histórico"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Notas","number":"4","index":"4","fromtitle":"Quartz/pt-br","byteoffset":1641,"anchor":"Notas","linkAnchor":"Notas"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Galeria","number":"5","index":"5","fromtitle":"Quartz/pt-br","byteoffset":1681,"anchor":"Galeria","linkAnchor":"Galeria"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"Ver também","number":"6","index":"6","fromtitle":"Quartz/pt-br","byteoffset":1745,"anchor":"Ver_também","linkAnchor":"Ver_também"},{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"R